        <div class="
          glue-grid__col
          glue-grid__col--span-4-sm
          glue-grid__col--span-12-md
          caption
          --center
        ">
          <p data-block-key="h2yvf"><i>Similar to few-shot prompting of an LLM (</i><b><i>left</i></b><i>), a time-series foundation model should support few-shot prompting with an arbitrary number of related in-context time series examples (</i><b><i>right</i></b><i>). The orange box encloses the inputs to the models.</i></p>
        </div>
      
