      </div>
    
  


          </div>
        </div>
      

      
        <div class="
          glue-grid__col
          glue-grid__col--span-4-sm
          glue-grid__col--span-12-md
          caption
          --center
        ">
          <p data-block-key="h2yvf"><i>TimesFM-ICF employs the decoder-only architecture for time-series forecasting with in-context examples. A special common separator token is introduced to disambiguate between the in-context examples and the task history.</i></p>
        </div>
      
